          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"qwen36-35b-a3b-uncensored-lokal-di-molab\">\ud83e\udd99 Qwen3.6-35B-A3B Uncensored \u2014 lokal di molab</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Q8_K_P \u00b7 MoE (3B aktif/token) \u00b7 vision \u00b7 context 262K native</strong></span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Semua berjalan di GPU sandbox ini (RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell, 96 GB VRAM) lewat\n<a href=\"https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">llama.cpp</a> build CUDA 12.8. Tanpa API key,\ntanpa data keluar dari sandbox.</span>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Model:</strong> <code>HauhauCS/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-Uncensored-HauhauCS-Aggressive</code> (GGUF Q8_K_P + mmproj f16)</li>\n<li><strong>Endpoint:</strong> OpenAI-compatible di <code>http://127.0.0.1:18080/v1</code> (marimo sendiri memakai :8080)</li>\n<li>Sandbox hanya menyimpan <code>notebook.py</code>. Kalau sandbox di-restart, cell\n  <code>server_start</code> akan mengunduh ulang bobot (~41 GB, sekitar 9 menit) lalu\n  menyalakan server sendiri.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
